{"title": "Ogre's Mark", "pageid": 18530, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ogre's_Mark", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ogre%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/2/24/Ogre%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Ogre%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Ogre's Mark</b> is a passive feature available to <a href=\"/wiki/Ogre\" title=\"Ogre\">Ogres</a> that grants an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a> damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Damage is increased by 1d6. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Buthir\" title=\"Buthir\">Buthir</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chock\" title=\"Chock\">Chock</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fank\" title=\"Fank\">Fank</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Glourik\" title=\"Glourik\">Glourik</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gurgon\" title=\"Gurgon\">Gurgon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lump\" title=\"Lump\">Lump</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mig\" title=\"Mig\">Mig</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ogre_Brute\" title=\"Ogre Brute\">Ogre Brute</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Polma\" title=\"Polma\">Polma</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714222924\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 731/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4329/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2489/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 517/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643700/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.619      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   29.619      1 -total\n 53.99%   15.991      1 Template:PageSeo\n 52.99%   15.696      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 34.29%   10.156      1 Template:DamageText\n 30.45%    9.019      1 Template:Damage_type\n 29.42%    8.715      1 Template:Icon_link\n 28.31%    8.385      1 Template:Icon_text\n 26.40%    7.819      7 Template:Trim\n 20.97%    6.210      1 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:18530-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714222924 and revision id 267673. Rendering